import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.S1551HDDImageGeneratorActual
import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.S1630HDDOutputImageActual

/-!
# S1638: faithful HDD rank-two O_v-lattice family from actual image generators

S1500 records the output-dependent rank-two HDD local lattice target
S1500OutputDependentHDDLattice, whose binding field was shown in S1513 to be
too weak by itself.  S1551 reduced the genuine binding to one actual
output-dependent image family together with one integral nonzero image point
per output and place.  S1476 supplies an actual free rank-two lattice
O_v^2 = s1476LocalLattice 2 v, but that lattice is output-independent and is
not the paper object.

This file constructs the faithful basic component from the actual integral
generators of the S1402 image:

* S1638HDDRankTwoFamily is a source together with an actual
  S1513ImageGeneratorFamily.  Its lattice is the diagonal O_v-span of the
  two actual image values at each output and place; its basis is an explicit
  O_v-basis whose vectors are exactly those image values.
* the lattice is free, finite, of rank two, integral and full in K_v^2;
  in particular it has rank > 1.
* toS1500 builds the S1500 target with the actual image generator; its
  imageGenerator is the actual image point, not an arbitrary choice.

The lattice is not definitionally the S1476 free lattice.  We prove the exact
criterion

  lattice o v = s1476LocalLattice 2 v  iff  all generator values are units in O_v.

The available SHE unit-section reading image gives exactly the free lattice
(proved), while the actual uniformizer q-candidates give a non-free
image-generated lattice (proved).  This exposes the precise sense in which the
free lattice is degenerate and is not used as the paper object.

The exact first missing structure is then recorded in two equivalent forms:

* S1638FirstMissing: an actual S1402 source whose image is output-dependent
  and which contains one integral nonzero point at every output and place;
* S1638HDDPaperImage: the same data bundled with the actual source.

From either form the faithful rank-two family and the S1500 target are
constructed.  The actual SHE reading image cannot supply the missing structure
because its image is output-independent, and the available det bookkeeping is
shown not to change the first-missing content (S1551 proves the stronger
opposite-status example for the same det data).  No inhabitant of the missing
structure is asserted.  No sorry, axiom, True/PUnit surrogate, rank-one
replacement or free-lattice stand-in is used.
-/

noncomputable section
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.checkUnivs false
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

namespace LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.S1638HDDRankTwoActual

